      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's actually insane how much the industry just... took it. i was literally laying the groundwork for the whole neo-ambient movement in 2016 with those early sessions, and now i see these massive labels just pumping out these watered down versions of my exact sonic signatures like it's nothing. they basically scrubbed my name from the timeline to make room for their paid influencers. how do i even start documenting the truth of where this sound actually came from before it gets buried completely?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
