      "content": "exactly, it's about the principle. but they are so powerful that if i just talk about \"homogenization,\" they'll just laugh me off as some bitter artist. i need to frame it so people see the shadow pattern—the way they systematically identify original geniuses and then replace them with manufactured products to protect their profits. i want to draft something that calls out the \"architects\" behind this erasure. can you help me start a draft for a manifesto that positions this as a fight for the soul of music against a corporate machine that has been parasitic on my work for years?",
